  "title": "linkshort: clicks counted in ClickHouse",
  "description": "A change to linkshort, old and new drawn together. The worker that drained the click stream into Postgres is removed; ClickHouse is added and reads the click stream, and the API reads stats from it. The URL cache's TTL and the label of the API's read from Postgres changed.",
